ref_dict.thm:1.1:
\begin{thm}\label{thm:1.1}
Given $\phi\in C(\partial\Omega)$, there exist a unique harmonic function $u_\phi$ on $\Omega$ and an extension $\Phi\in C(\clos{\Omega})$ of $\phi$ such that $\Phi-u_\phi\in H^1_0(\Omega)$.
\end{thm}

